OL,3,AZelensky says Ukraine has right to
OL,4,Adefend itself after Trump calls latest
OL,5,Astrikes a 'disgrace'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky has said
OL,8,Fhe is "only standing up for Ukraine's
OL,9,Finterests" after scathing criticism
OL,10,Ffrom Donald Trump, who said Kyiv's new
OL,11,Fwave of strikes on Russian oil
OL,12,Frefineries was a "disgrace".
OL,14,FThe US president, who recently made a
OL,15,Fcontroversial deal with Moscow to
OL,16,Fimport diesel, also said Zelensky was
OL,17,F"more difficult to deal with than
OL,18,F[Russian President Vladimir] Putin".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
